---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const breadcrumbSchema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'BreadcrumbList',
  itemListElement: [
    {
      '@type': 'ListItem',
      position: 1,
      name: 'Home',
      item: 'https://www.evstartups.com',
    },
    {
      '@type': 'ListItem',
      position: 2,
      name: 'Privacy Policy',
      item: 'https://www.evstartups.com/privacy',
    },
  ],
};
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | evStartups.com"
  description="Privacy policy and data collection disclosures for evStartups.com commercial EV software directory."
  jsonLd={breadcrumbSchema}
  noindex={true}
>
  <div class="bg-slate-50 min-h-screen pb-20">
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="border-b border-slate-200/80 bg-white py-12 sm:py-16">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6">
        <nav class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-medium text-slate-500 mb-4">
          <a href="/" class="hover:text-slate-900 transition">Home</a>
          <span>/</span>
          <span class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Privacy Policy</span>
        </nav>
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-4xl font-['Plus_Jakarta_Sans']">
          Privacy Policy
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-slate-500">
          Last Updated: October 5, 2026 &bull; Effective immediately for all visitors and users
        </p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Main Content Container with Centered Typography -->
    <main class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-12">
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8 sm:p-12 shadow-xs space-y-8 text-slate-700 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
        
        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 font-['Plus_Jakarta_Sans']">
            1. Overview & Scope
          </h2>
          <p>
            Welcome to <strong class="text-slate-900">evStartups.com</strong> ("we", "our", or "us"). We operate an independent commercial B2B research directory and comparison platform focused on electric vehicle fleet software, charge point management systems (CPMS), energy management tools, and connected vehicle telematics.
          </p>
          <p>
            This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and protect personal and professional information when you visit our website, submit requests for software pricing, or contact our editorial desk.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3 border-t border-slate-100 pt-6">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 font-['Plus_Jakarta_Sans']">
            2. Information We Collect
          </h2>
          <p>
            Because we operate primarily in a business-to-business (B2B) capacity, we collect information necessary to facilitate software evaluation and directory operations:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-600">
            <li>
              <strong class="text-slate-800">Professional Business Information:</strong> When you request pricing, schedule a product demo, or contact our editorial team, we may collect your name, corporate business email address, company name, job title, fleet vehicle count, depot location, and specific operational use cases.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong class="text-slate-800">Automated Usage Data & Analytics:</strong> We use standard web analytics tools to understand directory traffic, page views, referral sources, operating system, browser type, and dwell time. This data is collected in aggregate to improve user experience, page speed, and directory navigation.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong class="text-slate-800">Cookies & Technical Identifiers:</strong> We utilize essential and analytics cookies to maintain basic site security, remember filter preferences, and measure visitor engagement.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3 border-t border-slate-100 pt-6">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 font-['Plus_Jakarta_Sans']">
            3. Explicit Lead Sharing with Verified EV Software Vendors
          </h2>
          <div class="rounded-xl border border-emerald-200 bg-emerald-50/50 p-4 text-xs sm:text-sm text-emerald-950">
            <p class="font-semibold mb-1">Commercial Lead Sharing Disclosure:</p>
            <p>
              When you voluntarily submit a request for pricing, product information, or a software demonstration regarding a specific vendor profile (such as Ampcontrol, AMPECO, Driivz, Geotab, Monta, Samsara, or others), you explicitly consent to our sharing of your submitted professional contact details and fleet requirements with the designated vendor or their authorized enterprise sales representatives.
            </p>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">
            Once shared, the vendor's handling of your information is governed by their respective privacy policies. We do not sell, rent, or trade your contact information to unrelated third-party data brokers.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3 border-t border-slate-100 pt-6">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 font-['Plus_Jakarta_Sans']">
            4. How We Use Your Information
          </h2>
          <p>We use the collected information for the following business purposes:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-sm text-slate-600">
            <li>Routing software quote inquiries directly to requested EV software platforms.</li>
            <li>Responding to editorial corrections, profile updates, and vendor submissions.</li>
            <li>Analyzing aggregate directory usage to identify trending EV software protocols and buyer needs.</li>
            <li>Detecting and mitigating security risks, spam submissions, or abusive automated scraping.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3 border-t border-slate-100 pt-6">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 font-['Plus_Jakarta_Sans']">
            5. Data Retention & Security
          </h2>
          <p>
            We implement administrative, organizational, and technical safeguards to protect your professional data from unauthorized access or disclosure. We retain submitted inquiry data only for as long as necessary to fulfill lead routing, resolve editorial correspondence, or comply with applicable legal obligations.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3 border-t border-slate-100 pt-6">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 font-['Plus_Jakarta_Sans']">
            6. Your Privacy Rights (GDPR, CCPA & Global Users)
          </h2>
          <p>
            Depending on your jurisdiction, you may have the right to request access to the personal data we hold about you, request rectification or erasure of your information, or object to data processing. To exercise these rights, please contact our privacy desk.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3 border-t border-slate-100 pt-6">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 font-['Plus_Jakarta_Sans']">
            7. Contact Information
          </h2>
          <p>
            For any questions regarding this Privacy Policy, your personal information, or our data handling practices, please contact us at:
          </p>
          <div class="rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 p-4 text-xs sm:text-sm">
            <p class="font-bold text-slate-900">evStartups.com Legal & Privacy Desk</p>
            <p class="text-slate-600 mt-1">Email: <a href="mailto:privacy@evstartups.com" class="text-emerald-600 hover:underline">privacy@evstartups.com</a></p>
            <p class="text-slate-600">Editorial Desk: <a href="mailto:editorial@evstartups.com" class="text-emerald-600 hover:underline">editorial@evstartups.com</a></p>
          </div>
        </section>

      </div>
    </main>
  </div>
</Layout>
